B.bAr=new A.m1(B.z5,B.kW,"Opening Balance (Carry Fwd.)",'Represents all transactions from months BEFORE your selected date range.\n\nHow it works:\n1. At month end (e.g. 30 Apr), set the date range to that exact month.\n2. Click "Save Snapshot" in the GST Reconciliation tab.\n3. Next time you view May, the April snapshot appears as the opening row.\n4. Totals row = opening carry-fwd + current period.\n\nNo snapshot \u2192 row is hidden and a warning banner appears.\nData added after snapshot \u2192 \u26a0 badge appears. Click "Recreate Snapshot" to refresh.')
